mart (Point 5).\n\n2. **Applying Rule 16:**\n   - Rule 16 states: \"If Dave is cold, then Dave is red.\"\n   - Since Dave is cold, according to this rule, Dave must be red.\n\n3. **Conclusion:**\n   - Therefore, Dave is red, making the statement \"Dave is not red\" false.\n\n**Answer:** The correct option is: B) False",
