s earlier.\n\nSo, to recap:\n\n- Dog eats bald eagle (fact 7)\n- Conditional: If something eats the bald eagle, then it is red.\n- Therefore, dog is red.\n\nSo the answer should be A) True.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A",
