\nSo the correct answer is B) False.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: B) False\n\nThe reasoning process involves analyzing the given rules and applying them step by step to determine Bob's characteristics. Bob is not green and not kind, which leads to the conclusion that he is not furry based on the provided logical rules.",
