ment \"Charlie is not green\" is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B) False.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: B) False\n\nCharlie is young, which makes him red. Being red, he is furry, and all furry things are green. Therefore, Charlie is green, making the statement \"Charlie is not green\" false.",
