e rough. So if Bob were white, he would have to be cold and rough.\n\nBut Bob is gentle and warm, so he can't be rough or cold. Therefore, Bob can't be white. So the statement is true.\n\nSo the correct answer is A) True.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A) True",
