1. **Fiona's Attributes:** Fiona is white (Fact 7). From Fact 12, white things are round, so Fiona is round.\n\n2. **Possibility of Fiona Being Young:**\n   - If Fiona is rough (Fact 17), she would be white and young (Fact 18). However, Fiona's roughness isn't mentioned.\n   - If Fiona is not rough, her age isn't determined by the given facts.\n\n3. **Niceness and Smartness:**\n   - Fiona's niceness isn't mentioned. If she were nice, she'd be round (Fact 11), which she is, but this doesn't confirm her age.\n   - Smartness isn't linked to Fiona directly, though smart things are white (Fact 16).\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - Without information on Fiona's roughness or niceness, her age can't be definitively determined. Thus, whether Fiona is young or not remains unknown.\n\n**Answer:** The correct option is: C) Unknown",
