ut Charlie is round (from fact 14) and blue (from fact 11), so he must be big. But the context doesn't say anything about Charlie's size, so that's okay.\n\nSo, in conclusion, Charlie is young. So the statement is true.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A",
