es Big**: From point 13, being red means Fiona is big.\n\n3. **Red and Big Implies Nice**: From point 8, since Fiona is both red and big, she must be nice.\n\n4. **Conclusion**: Since Fiona is nice, the statement "Fiona is not nice" is false.\n\nThe correct option is: B) False', '']
