).\n- Green → furry (Rule 1).\n- Smart and furry → big (Rule 6).\n- Big → cold (Rule 5).\n\nThus, Gary is cold. The initial reasoning had an error in applying the rules. The correct answer is A) True.\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe correct option is: A) True', '']
