the given statements to determine the bald eagle\'s niceness. Key points include:\n\n1. Visiting the dog leads to eating the bald eagle (statement 14).\n2. Eating the bald eagle makes it rough (statement 15).\n3. Being rough implies the bald eagle is not nice.\n\nThus, the bald eagle is not nice, making the statement false.', '']
