re, the statement is unknown.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: C) Unknown\n\nThe statement \"Harry is green\" cannot be determined as true or false based on the given information. While Harry is smart and furry, the context does not provide any direct or indirect evidence about his color. Therefore, it remains unknown.",
