final_output:  ['</think>\n\nThe correct option is: B) False\n\nStep-by-step explanation:\n\n1. **Bob is round** (Fact 4).\n2. **If someone is round, they are blue** (Fact 18). Therefore, Bob must be blue.\n3. **Bob is nice and round**, so he is furry (Fact 12).\n4. **Bob is big and furry**, so he must be blue (Fact 17).\n5. Both deductions confirm Bob is blue, so the statement "Bob is blue" is true.\n\nThe correct option is: A) True', '']
