lie is round, which makes him white. Being white and round, he is furry. Furry people are rough, so Charlie is rough. As a round and rough person, he is big. Round and big people are cold, so Charlie is cold. Therefore, the statement \"Charlie is not cold\" is false.\n\nThe correct option is: B",
