 3).\n   - If something is white and nice, it is rough (Rule 5).\n   - Furry, nice things are young (Rule 6).\n   - Furry, young things are white (Rule 7).\n\n3. **Analysis:**\n   - Harry's attributes (nice, rough, white, young) don't directly link to being big.\n   - Being big implies being furry, but Harry's fur status isn't known.\n   - No rule explicitly states that being nice, rough, white, or young necessitates being big.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - There's insufficient information to confirm or deny that Harry is big.\n\n**Answer:** The correct option is: C) Unknown",
