d we don't have any information about whether it does or doesn't, then the answer is unknown.\n\nAlternatively, perhaps the rules imply that an animal cannot chase itself. Let me check.\n\nLooking at the rules, none of them mention an animal chasing itself. So, it's possible that the rules don't forbid it, but they also don't provide any information about it.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is unknown.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: C",
