oint 8, since she\'s blue, she\'s nice. So, she is nice. Therefore, from point 15, she is young, which is consistent.\n\nSo, everything seems to fit. Harry is white, so he\'s young. Therefore, the statement is true.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A) True', '']
