final_output:  ['So the correct answer is B) True.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: B) True\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Anne is Nice (Fact 1):** Anne is described as nice.\n\n2. **Nice Things are Quiet (Fact 13):** Since Anne is nice, she must be quiet.\n\n3. **Quiet Things are Round (Fact 14):** Being quiet, Anne is also round.\n\n4. **Round, Quiet Things are Young (Fact 11):** Since Anne is both round and quiet, she must be young.\n\n5. **Conclusion:** Therefore, the statement "Anne is young" is true.\n\n**Answer:** B) True', '']
