o she should be white, but it\'s not listed.\n\n6. **Check Rule 7**: White and furry things are smart. Anne and Erin fit this, so they\'re smart.\n\n7. **Determine Anne\'s Age**: Anne is rough but not nice, so Rule 6 doesn\'t apply. No other rules link her to being young.\n\n8. **Conclusion**: There\'s no information or rule that connects Anne to being young.\n\nThe correct option is: C) Unknown', '']
